  "_comment": "S9-F5: shared by packages/contracts/src/website-leads.test.ts (vitest) and tests/Integration/LeadFormValidationTest.php (PHPUnit). Each case is a contract body (WebsiteLeadBody for enquiry, WebsiteViewingRequestBody for viewing); both suites must give the stated verdict. {\"$repeat\":\"x\",\"times\":n} is a string of n copies; a slot's dayOffset is days from today (UTC). Not covered on purpose: pageUrl and lang (the form drops or defaults a bad value instead of refusing), blank phone/message (blank is absent in a form), multiple slots. The plugin strips markup from a message before sending it (sanitize_textarea_field): the verdict is the same as the contract's, which accepts angle brackets, but the stored text differs.",
